# License (English summary)

Copyright © 2026 Dmitry Batulin ([@dmitryprg-ai](https://github.com/dmitryprg-ai))

This repository is **dual-licensed**. Human-readable material is under
`CC-BY-NC-4.0`; machine-executed material is under
`PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0`.

- `CC-BY-NC-4.0` — `README.md`, `examples/**` (see `LICENSE-DOCS`)
- `PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0` — `scripts/**`, `.claude/**`,
  `templates/**` (see `LICENSE-CODE`)

The boundary follows purpose, not file extension: files under `.claude/`
and `templates/` are Markdown, but they are instructions executed by an
agent and meant to be modified per project, so a software license applies.
**If a file could fall under both, PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0 governs.**

Noncommercial use is permitted **with attribution**: keep the copyright
notice, link to https://github.com/dmitryprg-ai/Autonomic-Work-Kit, and
indicate if you made changes. Commercial use requires separate written
permission: **dmitryprg@gmail.com**

This is **source-available**, not open source: an OSI-approved license
must permit commercial use (https://opensource.org/osd), and neither
license here does.

This file is a map, not a license. Where it differs from the texts in
`LICENSE-DOCS` and `LICENSE-CODE`, those texts govern.
